+  - `const visibilityRunner = options.ompVisibilityRunner ?? runOmpVisibility;`, immediately after the `routingRunner` binding
+  - the visibility-plan block inside `before_agent_start`, inserted after the AutoInject `if/else` closes and before `mirror(session, "user_task", ...)`, exactly as specified (including the `OMP_VISIBILITY_MAX_INJECTED_CHARS` import addendum from the brief's note)
